20. Prototype Success Criteria

The prototype is successful if:

the player can complete a full run loop
suit identities are clearly felt during play
repeated suit use shapes the run
Champions create meaningful build choices
Flush is strong but not dominant
the game feels like its own system, not just a direct clone
21. One-Sentence Pitch

Fourfold Accord is a poker roguelike where suits are not just symbols, but evolving faction paths that grow stronger as you commit to them throughout a run.
